    factsAdvanced: {
      en: [
      "The name 'Neristan' comes from the Swedish words for 'Lower Town', as it was built on the lower ground near the original harbor.",
      "Kokkola was once home to the largest merchant fleet in Finland, and much of the wealth in Neristan was built on seafaring and trade.",
      "The district features the 'Roos House', a majestic merchant's home that now houses the K.H.Renlund Museum.",
      "Many of the houses in Neristan have survived several major fires that destroyed other parts of the city.",
      "Neristan is famous for its 'English Park' and its proximity to the Sunnanö area, where the sea used to reach in the 1700s."
    ],
      de: ["Der Name 'Neristan' stammt aus dem Schwedischen und bedeutet 'die untere Stadt', wo traditionell Handwerker und Seeleute lebten.", "Kokkola beheimatete im 19. Jahrhundert zeitweise die größte Handelsflotte ganz Finnlands.", "Viele der Holzhäuser in Neristan haben die verheerenden Brände überlebt, die andere Teile der Stadt zerstörten.", "Das Roos-Haus, ein prächtiges Kaufmannsheim in Neristan, beherbergt heute das Historische Museum der Stadt.", "An vielen Fenstern hängen 'Klatschspiegel', mit denen die Bewohner früher unauffällig das Treiben auf der Straße beobachten konnten."],
      hu: ["A Neristan negyedben szigorú szabályok védik az eredeti faablakokat, a színeket és a kő lábazatokat.", "A város egykor annyira fontos kátrány-exportőr volt, hogy a 18. században Finnország legnagyobb kereskedelmi flottájával rendelkezett.", "Egy 1854-es krími háborús incidens során a helyiek elfoglaltak egy brit hadihajót (Halkokari-csata), aminek mentőcsónakja ma is a város parkjában látható.", "A Neristan épületeit a tűzvész ellen nagyon széles, úgynevezett 'tűzutcákkal' választották el egymástól a 19. században.", "A város svéd neve Karleby, amely ma is a hivatalos kétnyelvű feliratokon olvasható, utalva az erős svéd hatásra."],
      ro: ["A luat naștere încă din anii timpurii ai anilor imediat prezenți după 1620, o dată ce Regele suveran nordic puternic scandinav Suedez imperial marele lider militar glorios a fondat localitatea administrativă oficial.", "Majoritatea clară a masivelor mari locuințe perfect pictate care predomină structura stradală romantică datează conservate strict arhitectural autentic integral vizual exact începând din marea epocă a secolului complet nou al XIX-lea.", "Numele arhaic original utilizat Neristan se distinge traducându-se liber cu expresia complet exactă a formei populare suedeze locale „Orașul direct de Jos”, separând de zona superioară Oppistan care aduna elita guvernamentală de stat nordică.", "Ușile bogat gravate clasic vizibile au micile deschizături istorice speciale cu oglinzi montate fixate lateral prin care vizitatorii sau locuitorii vedeau strada discret la adăpost.", "Din perimetrul central vechi strict interzis modernismului lipsesc cu desăvârșire orice fel de noi tipuri de intervenții contemporane din beton masiv urban pentru garantarea farmecului estetic liniștit atemporal unic național."]
    },
